# Conformance probe pack for the time-quality keys of core (engine-spec 0.32):
# both axes of goat's time hygiene and the attestation. Public. Synthetic. No
# line writes a value the entity does not hold: no default, no sentinel
# (tools/time-quality-guard.py).
format  conformance-time-hygiene
version 0.32.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
wire    json
field   time_error_ms       time_error_ms       float
field   time_state          time_state          string
field   time_utc_state      time_utc_state      string
field   time_utc_error_ms   time_utc_error_ms   float
field   time_anchor         time_anchor         string
field   time_anchor_age_ms  time_anchor_age_ms  int
field   time_attested       time_attested       int
field   time_attestation    time_attestation    string
